# SublimeAgent needs no secrets: it listens on 127.0.0.1 and calls no external
# service. Its only configuration is SublimeAgent.sublime-settings.
#
# If a secret is ever required, list it here as a 1Password reference — never a
# plaintext value — and resolve it at runtime with
# `op run --env-file=.env.example -- <command>`, wrapped in ./scripts/dev:
#
# EXAMPLE_API_KEY=op://sublime-agent/Example API/credential
